    "observations": [
      "The broad wing ridge and center gable are distinguished from the small transom dormers. Four gables form paired bays across the two transepts.",
      "The western entry has a covered shallow canopy, a large framed projecting bay, a separate upper attic window and a dominant lantern above the central gable.",
      "Darker structural trim, light plaster infill and warm terracotta are estimated from daylight photos. Lanterns have open shafts under a flared conical cap."
    ]
